Patch 0044 (vp34 post-gpu_timers+fbo_msaa, ported from Strikers 0057 + Carbon S9):
  - vglTexAnisoOff(GLboolean off): scoped per-texture anisotropic filtering toggle on the active unit's descriptor (ANISO_SWITCH).
  - vglSetTiledTargets(int mode) / vglTexMakeTiledTarget (rejects display textures) / vglTiledStats / vglTexIsTiled: opt-in hardware 32x32 tiled RGBA8 render targets (default off).
Applies AFTER gpu_timers.py and fbo_msaa.py.
